  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a sygican ranged weapon.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Cost</strong> 2 battery charges</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Your weapon can launch a shot that arcs up, over, and around at a target you know is there, even if you can’t see them. Your Engram has the following effect.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Ingrave (Manipulate, 2 charges) </strong>Make a ranged Strike against a creature up to three times your ranged increment without penalty. You ignore any bonuses the target might have from Cover or Concealment, unless they are protected from above.</p>"
